{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, כְּהַל","hw":"כְּהַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be able (</strong>𝔗 id.<em>;</em> Egyptian Aramaic, S-C<sup>Pap. A 6, 8, 11 +</sup>; Ethiopic ክህለ cf. syn. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, יְכִל\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_יְכִל\", dir=\"rtl\">יְכִל</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pt. act., usually sq. inf.: abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּהֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:26\" href=\"/Daniel.2.26\">Dn 2:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">4:15</a> (inf. om.); pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּֽהֲלִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:8\" href=\"/Daniel.5.8\">5:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:15\" href=\"/Daniel.5.15\">15</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, כָּהֵן","prev":"BDB Aramaic, כָּה"}